  "changes": {
    "MouseMessageHandler": "Restore donor case order and the shared coordinate tail inside the switch. Retain the ReleaseCapture result assignment at both release sites, as retail stores EAX into the captureReleased local; the old tracing calls remain absent. HoMM1 coordinate scaling, assertion identity and cursor checks remain intact.",
    "widget::Main": "Explicitly mask incoming flag values with 0xffff before setting flags or storing the clear-mask local. Apply the whole-unit G5 control; all annotated widget bodies are now exact.",
    "GetMoveShowIt": "Use the donor dx local spelling; all narrow HoMM1 types and visibility conditions are unchanged.",
    "highScoreManager constructor": "Assign the logical-not result directly to the campaign flag instead of branching to separate constant stores.",
    "highScoreManager::Main": "Read the message type before the dispatch mask; recover donor result/entry local names.",
    "highScoreManager::Update": "Restore conditional expressions for the title/subtitle frames, selected buttons and record visibility command. Recover donor highScore/rank/inputFile/noScoreFile/hsMessage/scorePath names and declaration order, while retaining HoMM1 byte flag, file record layout, drawing operations and localization. The original signed-byte score-type conversion is retained; the function is not exact."
  },
